    "detailed_description": "<h1>JOIN OUR OFFICIAL DISCORD COMMUNITY</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2748770/extras/b87bd98311d7a9af862105f605b31d3d.avif?t=1754115977\" width=604 height=128 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get the latest news, vote on features, and chat with the dev team!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udfe3 Search for our server on Discord: Dala and The Cursed Forest</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2748770/extras/d9b20d36181a93ce3a75a603fcb4e77f.poster.avif?t=1754115977\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2748770/extras/d9b20d36181a93ce3a75a603fcb4e77f.webm?t=1754115977\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2748770/extras/d9b20d36181a93ce3a75a603fcb4e77f.mp4?t=1754115977\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Dala and the Cursed Forest is a Roguelike Deckbuilder with a unique card fusion mechanic.<br><strong>\u2022  Choose from distinct decks to start off your run.</strong><br><strong>\u2022  Strategically play, combine, and transform cards while using different items to overcome an array of creatures.</strong><br><strong>\u2022  Earn rewards and discover new cards throughout your journey.</strong><br><strong>\u2022  Conquer over the forbidden forest and restore peace to Dala\u2019s sanctuary.</strong><br><strong>\u2022  Start over from the beginning when you die!</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2748770/extras/7ad694f4599bfbe432171fddb7ae37d7.webp?t=1754115977\" width=468 height=54 /></span><br>Build the deck the way you want to play.<br><i>Your card choices affect how well you can go up against different monsters.</i><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2748770/extras/da1712b7c0d7fa3d69c54839538ba7f8.avif?t=1754115977\" width=600 height=240 /></span><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2748770/extras/3a647078cf124e12863c1ffa78165b6a.webp?t=1754115977\" width=468 height=54 /></span><br>Combine different cards to create a more powerful card!<br><i>But remember there are times when it might be better to keep things separate.</i><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2748770/extras/f9420f0af98d0ed80a26d6dfa562b00f.poster.avif?t=1754115977\" width=600 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2748770/extras/f9420f0af98d0ed80a26d6dfa562b00f.webm?t=1754115977\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2748770/extras/f9420f0af98d0ed80a26d6dfa562b00f.mp4?t=1754115977\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2748770/extras/38fb343a8a862fba3e61334253d27ef5.webp?t=1754115977\" width=468 height=54 /></span><br>Transform Dala into powerful forms unlocking new cards and abilities.<br><i>Combine cards to create a Cell that can be used to power up your skills.<br>Gather four identical Cells to transform into a special form with powerful new cards that let you swing the fight in your favor!</i><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2748770/extras/360afd8950423e4d6881f84891fa26a2.poster.avif?t=1754115977\" width=600 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2748770/extras/360afd8950423e4d6881f84891fa26a2.webm?t=1754115977\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2748770/extras/360afd8950423e4d6881f84891fa26a2.mp4?t=1754115977\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2748770/extras/bcea3852d8cccca1bf9d3082cdd4ad43.webp?t=1754115977\" width=468 height=54 /></span><br>Encounter surprising events that can bless or curse your run.<br><i>Each choice you make impacts the items you collect and your odds of survival.</i><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2748770/extras/146b65626001e7b369c8b50a3d48e8a4.avif?t=1754115977\" width=600 height=240 /></span><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2748770/extras/4fdbf1772da3880aef50845ed8924f8e.webp?t=1754115977\" width=468 height=54 /></span><br>Cook renowned Thai cuisine at this feline restaurant run by a quirky cat chef.<br><i>Use ingredients from defeated monsters to prepare meals that grant special buffs.<br>Meet the Shopkeeper to buy new cards, equipment, and potions, or sell items to earn currency.</i><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2748770/extras/c62f7745bef8fb1d0b2e0a0dbb82f9ec.poster.avif?t=1754115977\" width=600 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2748770/extras/c62f7745bef8fb1d0b2e0a0dbb82f9ec.webm?t=1754115977\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2748770/extras/c62f7745bef8fb1d0b2e0a0dbb82f9ec.mp4?t=1754115977\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>A forbidden forest has been cursed by the misuse of a mysterious power, spreading corruption across the land and its creatures. Join Dala on her quest to restore peace as she explores and purifies the forest of its corrupted inhabitants.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >When Dala and the Cursed Forest leaves Early Access, it will come with:</h2>\u2022  Four Gods, each with their own unique set of cards.<br>\u2022  400+ normal cards and combined cards.<br>\u2022  80+ different items to be found.<br>\u2022  80+ unique combat encounters.<br>\u2022  40+ mysterious events and mini-games.<br>\u2022  A tale from the Cursed Forest.<br>\u2022  20+ skills on the talent tree for Dala and her Fairy.",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2748770/extras/d9b20d36181a93ce3a75a603fcb4e77f.poster.avif?t=1754115977\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2748770/extras/d9b20d36181a93ce3a75a603fcb4e77f.webm?t=1754115977\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2748770/extras/d9b20d36181a93ce3a75a603fcb4e77f.mp4?t=1754115977\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Dala and the Cursed Forest is a Roguelike Deckbuilder with a unique card fusion mechanic.<br><strong>\u2022  Choose from distinct decks to start off your run.</strong><br><strong>\u2022  Strategically play, combine, and transform cards while using different items to overcome an array of creatures.</strong><br><strong>\u2022  Earn rewards and discover new cards throughout your journey.</strong><br><strong>\u2022  Conquer over the forbidden forest and restore peace to Dala\u2019s sanctuary.</strong><br><strong>\u2022  Start over from the beginning when you die!</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2748770/extras/7ad694f4599bfbe432171fddb7ae37d7.webp?t=1754115977\" width=468 height=54 /></span><br>Build the deck the way you want to play.<br><i>Your card choices affect how well you can go up against different monsters.</i><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2748770/extras/da1712b7c0d7fa3d69c54839538ba7f8.avif?t=1754115977\" width=600 height=240 /></span><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2748770/extras/3a647078cf124e12863c1ffa78165b6a.webp?t=1754115977\" width=468 height=54 /></span><br>Combine different cards to create a more powerful card!<br><i>But remember there are times when it might be better to keep things separate.</i><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2748770/extras/f9420f0af98d0ed80a26d6dfa562b00f.poster.avif?t=1754115977\" width=600 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2748770/extras/f9420f0af98d0ed80a26d6dfa562b00f.webm?t=1754115977\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2748770/extras/f9420f0af98d0ed80a26d6dfa562b00f.mp4?t=1754115977\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2748770/extras/38fb343a8a862fba3e61334253d27ef5.webp?t=1754115977\" width=468 height=54 /></span><br>Transform Dala into powerful forms unlocking new cards and abilities.<br><i>Combine cards to create a Cell that can be used to power up your skills.<br>Gather four identical Cells to transform into a special form with powerful new cards that let you swing the fight in your favor!</i><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2748770/extras/360afd8950423e4d6881f84891fa26a2.poster.avif?t=1754115977\" width=600 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2748770/extras/360afd8950423e4d6881f84891fa26a2.webm?t=1754115977\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2748770/extras/360afd8950423e4d6881f84891fa26a2.mp4?t=1754115977\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2748770/extras/bcea3852d8cccca1bf9d3082cdd4ad43.webp?t=1754115977\" width=468 height=54 /></span><br>Encounter surprising events that can bless or curse your run.<br><i>Each choice you make impacts the items you collect and your odds of survival.</i><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2748770/extras/146b65626001e7b369c8b50a3d48e8a4.avif?t=1754115977\" width=600 height=240 /></span><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2748770/extras/4fdbf1772da3880aef50845ed8924f8e.webp?t=1754115977\" width=468 height=54 /></span><br>Cook renowned Thai cuisine at this feline restaurant run by a quirky cat chef.<br><i>Use ingredients from defeated monsters to prepare meals that grant special buffs.<br>Meet the Shopkeeper to buy new cards, equipment, and potions, or sell items to earn currency.</i><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2748770/extras/c62f7745bef8fb1d0b2e0a0dbb82f9ec.poster.avif?t=1754115977\" width=600 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2748770/extras/c62f7745bef8fb1d0b2e0a0dbb82f9ec.webm?t=1754115977\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2748770/extras/c62f7745bef8fb1d0b2e0a0dbb82f9ec.mp4?t=1754115977\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>A forbidden forest has been cursed by the misuse of a mysterious power, spreading corruption across the land and its creatures. Join Dala on her quest to restore peace as she explores and purifies the forest of its corrupted inhabitants.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >When Dala and the Cursed Forest leaves Early Access, it will come with:</h2>\u2022  Four Gods, each with their own unique set of cards.<br>\u2022  400+ normal cards and combined cards.<br>\u2022  80+ different items to be found.<br>\u2022  80+ unique combat encounters.<br>\u2022  40+ mysterious events and mini-games.<br>\u2022  A tale from the Cursed Forest.<br>\u2022  20+ skills on the talent tree for Dala and her Fairy.",
